# What must NOT reach an agent image.
#
# The harness (contract doubles, the SIGKILL child, the raw PostgreSQL reader,
# the divergence probe) speaks on raw sockets, spawns processes and opens the
# stand's database directly. All of that is legitimate in a source checkout and
# forbidden inside a container by the same rules `ahp-sdk check` enforces - so it
# is not shipped, rather than shipped-and-tolerated.
ahp_state/tests/
ahp_memory/tests/
ahp_clients/tests/
tests/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.venv/
venv/
